# Project Overview

**Next.js 16 + tRPC Monorepo**

## Tech Stack

- **Framework**: Next.js 16 (App Router) + React 19
- **API**: tRPC 11 + TanStack Query
- **Database**: PostgreSQL + Drizzle ORM
- **Auth**: Better Auth
- **UI**: Radix UI + Tailwind v4 + CVA
- **Monorepo**: Turborepo + Bun
- **Type Safety**: Strict TypeScript

## Core Principles

✅ **End-to-end type safety** (database → API → UI)
✅ **Strict validation** (Zod schemas everywhere)
✅ **Server Components first** (RSC by default)
✅ **Structured logging** (no console.log)
✅ **Protected by default** (explicit public routes)
✅ **Performance-first** (indexes, caching, prefetching)

## Package Manager

Use **Bun** for all operations:
```bash
bun install          # Install dependencies
bun run dev          # Development server
bun run build        # Production build
bun run check        # Lint & format
bun run check:types  # Type checking
bun test             # Run tests
```
